msgstr "Depurador detido"

#: languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerplugin.cpp:682
msgid "Runs the program in the debugger"
msgstr "Executa o programa no depurador"

#: languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerplugin.cpp:683
msgid ""
"Start in debugger\n"
"\n"
"Starts the debugger with the project's main executable. You may set some "
"breakpoints before this, or you can interrupt the program while it is "
"running, in order to get information about variables, frame stack, and so on."
msgstr ""
"Iniciar no depurador\n"
"\n"
"Inicia o depurador co executábel principal do programa. Pode estabelecer "
"algúns pontos de parada antes disto, ou pode interromper o programa mentres "
"está a executarse, para obter información acerca de variábeis, pila de "
"chamada, etc."

#: languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerplugin.cpp:697
msgid "&Continue"
msgstr "&Continuar"

#: languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerplugin.cpp:698
msgid "Continues the application execution"
msgstr "Continúa coa execución do programa"

#: languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerplugin.cpp:699
msgid ""
"Continue application execution\n"
"\n"
"Continues the execution of your application in the debugger. This only takes "
"effect when the application has been halted by the debugger (i.e. a "
"breakpoint has been activated or the interrupt was pressed)."
msgstr ""
"Continuar a execución do programa\n"
"\n"
"Continúa a execución do seu programa no depurador. Isto só ten efeito cando "
"o programa fose detido polo depurador (i.e. un ponto de parada foi activado "
"ou premeuse en interromper)."

